// 递归与泛型：条件按声明求一次；自引用、互引用、实参不断增长的递归都收敛
class Resource(n: Int) deinit
class PlainCycle(next: PlainCycle?)
class ResourceCycle(next: ResourceCycle?, item: Resource)
class MutualA(next: MutualB?)
class MutualB(next: MutualA?, item: Rc<Int>)
class Node<T>(item: T, next: Box<Node<T>>?)
class Grow<T>(item: T, next: Grow<List<T>>?)
class Swap<A, B>(item: A, next: Swap<B, A>?)
class Pair<A, B>(first: A, second: B)
class Phantom<T>(n: Int)
expect EarlyDrop PlainCycle = yes
expect Transferable PlainCycle = yes
expect EarlyDrop ResourceCycle = no
expect Transferable MutualA = no
expect why Transferable MutualA = MutualA.next -> MutualB? -> MutualB.item -> Rc<Int>（不满足 Transferable）
expect Transferable Node = if T: Transferable
expect EarlyDrop Node<Resource> = no
expect EarlyDrop Node<Int> = yes
expect Transferable Grow = if T: Transferable
expect EarlyDrop Grow<Resource> = no
expect Transferable Swap = if A: Transferable, B: Transferable
expect Transferable Swap<Int, Rc<Int>> = no
expect Transferable Pair = if A: Transferable, B: Transferable
expect Transferable Pair<Int, String> = yes
expect Transferable Phantom = yes
expect Transferable Phantom<Rc<Int>> = yes
